<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling unchanged against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling unchanged against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was unchanged against the dollar on Tuesday but strengthened against the pound, the Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 597.7719 to the dollar, unchanged from Monday, and 964.6275 against the pound, compared with 977.0723 on Monday.</p>
</text>
